  "intro": [
    "Every AWS Resource Groups operation the emulator advertises, and what Emuplane does",
    "with it. The service is REST/JSON under the `resource-groups` credential scope, with",
    "group lifecycle as POST routes and tags addressed by group ARN, and has no console",
    "action. A group is keyed by name; `SearchResources` answers an empty index because",
    "the emulator keeps no global resource index."
